  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of new WaL upscaling video</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Water as Leverage (WaL) programme aims to expand its communication strategy by highlighting successful projects from its various initiatives. The goal is to showcase the programme&#x2019;s impact and inspire broader engagement in climate resilience efforts.WaL is working with local and international experts in seven cities&#x2014;Chennai, Semarang, Khulna, Cartagena, Harlingen, Bangkok and Nakuru&#x2014;to develop climate-adaptive urban solutions that can be scaled globally.A new video will build on previous WaL project videos, emphasizing the contributions of local leaders and communities, and highlighting the programme&#x2019;s inclusive, community-driven approach to climate adaptation.The video will also demonstrate how initial projects have paved the way for expansion and serve as a call to action for greater involvement in the initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
